Third-party notice

drama3/ re-implements parts of the inference of Fish Audio Drama 3
(https://huggingface.co/fishaudio/drama-3) and calls the modules of
fish-speech (https://github.com/fishaudio/fish-speech) at run time. This
repository contains no fish-speech code, model weights or codec. Fish Audio
Drama 3, its codec and fish-speech belong to Fish Audio (39 AI, INC.) and
are licensed under the Fish Audio Community License, Version 1.0
(https://huggingface.co/fishaudio/drama-3/blob/main/LICENSE), not under the
MIT License above. Images built with scripts/build_drama3.sh include
fish-speech; distribute such an image only with a copy of that license and
its Notice file.

Built with Fish Audio.
